73","15750839207814313644","12111587041255723109","9820102443917179564","9978026429413160220","7411809582374456143","10106148985112540665","10412181790758222104","1457132352898609128","3674007340493464398","3995404980503708541","11970011844889851432","6251877187325150689","8403957443910635785","17353068861478007601","14635077156251567330","15551003062578929598","5253626362619656918"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-2c99bf01ecaeb4ac8416","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"s0a215e4feccbc956","text":"이봐, 「적막의 영주」! 여기 왔어? 내 말을 듣고 있는 거야?——난 #83 회원 헤르타야, 널 만나고 싶어. 우린 분명 말이 잘 통할 거라고","speaker":"헤르타","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["10412034460607004612"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3590006581088555600","2297981896746972443","16781246343418705370","11140738802242775587","12655737318672130966","4443542792872347987","503005073895011016","11562451843325109825","6548832256366079839","8928712419804480967","2070987760905893308","13947330654096747617","7986829146747294773","15750839207814313644","12111587041255723109","9820102443917179564","9978026429413160220","7411809582374456143","10106148985112540665","10412181790758222104","1457132352898609128","3674007340493464398","3995404980503708541","11970011844889851432","6251877187325150689","8403957443910635785","17353068861478007601","14635077156251567330","15551003062578929598","5253626362619656918"],"speakerUnresolved":false},{"id":"other-interaction-p2402-e4bdca9085649df95f5b","entryId":"other-interaction-p2402","chapterId":"s0a215e4feccbc956","text":"잔다르•원•쿠와바라, 지니어스 클럽 #1 회원이야. 잔다르의 초상화를 걸어둔 건 단순히 경의를 표하기 위함이지. 잔다르가 없었다면 지금의 지니어스 클럽도 없으니까","speaker":"헤르타","mission":"상호작용 기록","scene":"상호작용 1","type":"dialogue","textHashCandidates":["16286226231413234024"],"speakerHashCandidates":["3590006581088555600","2297981896746972443","16781246343418705370","11140738802242775587","12655737318672130966","4443542792872347987","503005073895011016","11562451843325